    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Against a lightning lycan’s rank four strike, Fang Yuan raises Thunder Shield Gu with Sky Canopy Gu. A round lightning shield forms in front of him, then lasts less than a second before the lycan’s lightning breaks it. A rank four Gu attack needs at least two rank three Gu to defend against it, and Lightning Shield Gu, the same Gu under another name, died because earlier fighting had already injured it. After the hit, Thunder Shield Gu is already dead, while Thunderwings Gu barely holds onto life and Sky Canopy Gu is heavily injured.",
        "chapters": [
          168
        ],
