  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "During the clash of Gu Yue clan and Bai clan on Qing Mao Mountain, Fang Yuan first passes it up while hunting for a healing Gu among the escaping worms, then grabs it when Bai Ning Bing closes in and he needs the best alternative at hand. The Gu raises its lightning shield against his hand. He releases Spring Autumn Cicada’s aura, the shield drops, and he refines it at once.",
